<title>PHILIPPINES: Philrealty says to sell PRCI shares.</title>
<headline>Philrealty says to sell PRCI shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Realty and Holdings Corp (Philrealty) said on Wednesday it signed an agreement to sell 165.24 million Philippine Racing Club Inc shares at 12 pesos to Malaysia's Leisure Management Bhd.</p>
</text>
